🧠 Advanced Prompting Concepts

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Temperature (Concept)

* Low → More accurate
* High → More creative

---

🔹 Prompt Chaining

Break complex tasks into smaller steps.

---

🔹 System Prompts

Control behavior of AI.

```text id="system_prompt"
